{"id":"23dbae98-594e-4c28-937f-196c716d1776","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"3002bee8fb6b90cc#3","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/margin/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"7ea172b999bc5933a34df01fc5811cc49c2de77d","start":7306,"end":7337},"shape":{"type":"MemberExpression","atoms":["vscode",".","commands",".","registerCommand"]},"context":{"before":"95049e7800c6d355","after":"b20ab1fc1a207297#1"}},"payload":{"text":"(the picker's the capabilities extension's: a stop's answered by what it picks)","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:46:07.235Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:46:07.235Z"}
{"id":"3a3eedca-b610-4c60-a3a9-8645643f4364","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"eefb57d50eea9883","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/margin/extension.ts","baseline":{"blob":"151bf726516b54534a76308ce35d4589ae76414f","start":0,"end":76},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","AskEvent",",","CapabilityChoice","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/editor-api","\""]},"context":{"after":"f87f376d8040740f"}},"payload":{"text":"The Margin: the file's runtime column, a pane view beside the code (ARCHITECTURE.md, *Extension points* 4). A run stopped\nat a gated call asks here, on the line it stopped at: what the call would do, and Allow, Skip or Deny, each\nfor this call, this run or always, the choice sent back to the session (`editor.capability.decide`), which resumes it.\n\nIn the margin rather than a notification because a program waiting on a person has to say so for as long as it waits:\na notification can be dismissed, and then nothing says it's stopped (the user, 2026-11-03). So the question stays until\nit's answered or the run moves on.\n\nFrom every debugger's `ask` event (the run contract). A run's values, and how it ended short, are values.ts's; coverage's\nmarks are its gutter column's (coverage.ts); giving a value a run uses is mock.ts's, a rule's place in the code placed.ts's, and\nwhat a run after an edit does with a call it can't make pin.ts's.","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:46:16.362Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:46:16.362Z"}
